## 1. Format-1 plugin market index validator

`scripts/lib/market-index-validator.mjs` is a verbatim copy of
`lib/index.js` from the package `@deepseek-ai/dsh-plugin-market-index`
(MIT, Copyright (c) DeepSeek), distributed with DeepSeek Harness. The only
change is the `semver` import: this repository points it at
`scripts/lib/semver-lite.mjs`, a local implementation of the two functions the
validator uses (`validRange`, `rcompare`), so no `semver` dependency is needed.

## 2. Model-facing `ask_user_question` schema

`packages/dsh-desktop-question-popup/lib/shadow-tool.js` reproduces the
model-facing contract of the timed `ask_user_question` tool from
`@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-ask-user` (MIT, Copyright (c) DeepSeek), distributed with
DeepSeek Harness: the tool `description`, the `parameters` JSON Schema (including
the `timeout` parameter text and the `-1` wording), the output `oneOf` schema,
and the pending-result notice are copied field by field so the model sees the
same contract as DSH's own timed mode.

